WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.000
Vegans Explore is the Vegan community's home base,
and you can start using it today, free.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:13.700
Find Vegan restaurants, brands, rescues and sanctuaries
city by city, ranked by member votes.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.100
Listen to podcasts and watch videos
from Vegan creators, right here on the platform.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.900
Open the Guides, and see what's happening in your city.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:30.800
With a Passport, you take part: vote for the places you love,
check in, and take on bounties for points you can give back.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.700
And what we build next comes from you.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.800
You've had a taste. Get the rest with your Passport,
$11 before January 1, or keep looking around today.
